				},
				"string" : "## Gate and remaining seams\nExact prior execution 5fi5alspuzq4agiz6174lb08r was found in the same parent's object storage (retained execution {{gtObject:id=20mgz7wp2tb1vhqq98qqq1zie}}, parent storage {{gtObject:id=epfxwhi4howvn7agfkk63q6xs}}). Provider/chat observed idle; no nonterminated process with receiver equal to that execution/chat/provider was found ({{gtObject:id=f10ay7urqmebfhf9nuhik4qww}}). All same-parent prior Maintainers were idle, excluding exact self 2y7gph9q05046umyab5k8t8qj identified by identical task prompt and current tool object storage. Original timeout record and current successful initial checkpoint retained: {{gtObject:id=2u7pr83g0kkp6vapbdqho8kdg}}. Original prior responseMessage nil; prior errors remain in its child object storage, including editor thread/matrix/toolbar/memento failures ({{gtObject:id=2xttbjc2rqh8krnee04mq4n6b}}). No termination/stop/reset/replay/undo performed. Cessation does not verify previous Foundation partial edits.\n\nNext extension seams (not implemented): BVCFairyAgentExecution>>gtViewAgentFor: and BVCFairyAgentProblem for retained child activity; GtLChatExecutionStateChanged for observed phases; provider API calls/tokens views and GtLMessageTokensData for reported usage (unknown is not zero; aggregate without double counting). GtLNewMessageViewModel>>attachFile: and GtLNewMessageElement>>initializeAttachButtonElement already attach via selector; send uses BVCFairyChat>>sendFiles:withMessage:. The inherited send clears draft/files before sending: failure-safe draft retention is still a gap. Window drop, thumbnails/removal/inspection, provider support distinction, live child status/timing, usage integration and follow-at-bottom behavior remain target work. No drop handler or telemetry added.\n\nONE next action: review this increment interactively via barryEntryPoint and diagnose the retained UI-thread title regression before widening to activity/usage/drop."
			}
